      "value": "Commenting to say that the fix seemed to be disabling my 2.5gbit ethernet adapter, and instead using my 1gbit ethernet OR my WiFi OR a VPN (either of those 3 worked).\nThis update seems to be really picky about which adapters you have enabled.",
